  "2026-10-12T17:17:35.000Z","harness:codex","Operational proof: the shared verifier passes installed npm/npx/Bun/bunx and every package bin, with missing-bin controls. Package doctor activates four extensions with zero blocking failures; update-check coverage is partial. Required Sentry/telemetry gate passes with zero critical/high issues, 3.01 percent finish error rate and zero missing error-code rows. The fresh 24-hour hosted trace query returns zero rows, so fresh trace retention remains unverified. A local flush drains five events to zero; the broker queue is empty. Backend table inspection shows 148 starts and 148 finishes since intake; per-session pairing is verified separately using the authoritative session_id column."
  "2026-10-12T17:22:04.531Z","harness:codex","TypeScript-ESLint 8.71.1 installed after October12 17:08:41.691UTC, retaining the seven-day cooldown. Its Node/ESLint/TypeScript peer contract matches this repository. marked 18.1.0 is also installed. Fresh patch/minor updates remain younger than seven days; unsupported major upgrades stay with their existing owners. Full typechecks, unchanged static quality and full coverage now verify both eligible updates."
  "2026-10-12T18:23:50.809Z","harness:codex","Verification sequencing: a packed smoke command launched while full coverage retained the build lease timed out waiting to pack. The standalone three-runtime specific packed proof still passes on Node24, Node26 and Bun. Rerun general npm/npx/Bun/bunx acceptance after source validation releases the lease, retaining its original timeout and genuine artifact checks."
  "2026-10-12T19:40:06.231Z","harness:codex","PR1453 CodSpeed reports encodeQueryCursor 206.6us to210.1us (-1.69%) as a neutral comparison with a runtime-environment warning. Chrome report inspection confirms baseline AMD EPYC7763 versus candidate EPYC9V74; pagination.ts, serialization.ts and the benchmark fixture are unchanged from base a91fed3. This is an unconfirmed cross-CPU comparison, separate from the passing unchanged absolute SDK-import and CLI-transport gates. No budget, threshold, feature or provider configuration was weakened."
